<title>USA: Cascade Communications names chairman.</title>
<headline>Cascade Communications names chairman.</headline>
<dateline>WESTFORD, Mass. 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cascade Communications Corp said on Thursday the company's co-founder and executive vice president Gururaj Deshpande was named chairman.</p>
<p>Deshpande succeeded Victoria Brown, who would remain a Class I director, the company said. Deshpande would continue as executive vice president, Cascade said.</p>
<p>He would oversee Cascade's business development efforts and would be actively involved in formulating the company's overall strategy, with particular emphasis on product direction, Cascade said.</p>
<p>Cascade provides carrier-class frame relay, asynchronous transfer mode, Internet protocol and remote access switching products.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
